{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/masa-residences-christies-al-marjan-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":683,"crm_id":"580","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Masa Residences","slug":"masa-residences-christies-al-marjan-island","display_address":"Al Marjan Island","building_type":["apartment","villa"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Christie's","price":1510650,"display_price":"1.5M ","lattitude":25.6767284,"longitude":55.7185223,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Masa Residences - an amazing project located on Al Marjan Island in Ras Al Khaimah. The design of the complex was developed together with the famous French architect and designer - Philippe Starck and has a unique exquisite architecture. For sale are apartments with <strong>1 and 2 bedrooms and villas</strong>, which perfectly combine luxury and harmony with nature, and from the panoramic windows open picturesque views of the Persian Gulf.</p><p>The complex has a gym, tennis court, swimming pool, spa, sauna, playgrounds and sports fields and a park with recreational areas and walking paths. The residents of the complex also have access to a private beach area, various retail outlets orientated for all occasions.</p><p>Due to the strategic location of the complex residents can quickly get to various attractions and social infrastructure. Al Hamra Mall, Al Marjan Island Beach and Wynn Casino are just 5 minutes away, Ras Al Khaimah International Airport is 10 minutes away and Dubai International Airport is about 55 minutes away.</p><p>Dubai International Airport is approximately 55 minutes away.</p><p>Each Masa Residences is designed to create a modern, functional and cosy ambience to ensure residents live a comfortable life.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":